{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A SPOOKY FAIRY TALE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An old lady in a dark thatched cottage, a ghost in the cellar, and some creepy animals : You play the Carimara, and your mission is to conjure a ghost by answering their questions using your cards.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You'll find here :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udfe1 A well polished tiny world with unique retro style,\u00a0<br>- \ud83d\udc80 Low horror and dark fantasy aesthetic, at first person pov<br>- \ud83c\udccf Point&amp;click mechanics, with card based dialogs system,<br>- \ud83c\udf42 A love letter to nature and old fantastic movies, with stop motion animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay features\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udd0e<strong> :\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk and collect cards by clicking on objects on the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use these cards on different characters, to know what they think of it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay attention to every detail, to understand what happened</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You'll need  :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0\u2328\ufe0f A mouse and a keyboard to play<br>- \u231b Between 30m and 1h to finish it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Inspired by obscure Normandy folklore, almost all textures and sounds are hand made and come from photos or record from the french country side.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Hope you'll enjoy it as much as I\u00a0did while creating it!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bastinus Rex</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570370?t=1744984848","bac